00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Every import needs a defensible decision.
Validate the rows. Resolve the exceptions. Preserve the evidence.

00:10.000 --> 00:22.000
Fictional sample: 22 rows imported.
16 accepted. 6 held for review.

00:22.000 --> 00:34.000
Record a review correction separately.
Keep the imported source value available for comparison.

00:34.000 --> 00:46.000
A stale update returns HTTP 409.
Retain the draft, refresh the revision and review before retrying.

00:46.000 --> 00:58.000
Freeze a revision before exporting.
The CSV and manifest belong to that revision.

00:58.000 --> 01:09.000
React + TypeScript. Node.js API. SQLite.
